flowchart LR
  R[Promoted sealed release]
  P1[Persisted - runtime current pointer]
  P2[Persisted - installed package link]
  P3[Persisted - installed CLI bin link]
  P4[Persisted - on-disk service definitions]
  L1[Live - loaded gateway arguments]
  L2[Live - gateway process argv and open files]
  L3[Live - loaded node arguments]
  L4[Live - node process argv and open files]
  V{All persisted and live surfaces resolve to the same release}
  OK[Live promotion accepted]
  SB[Persisted-not-applied - pointer, definition and process disagree, evidence preserved]
  R --> P1
  R --> P2
  R --> P3
  R --> P4
  P4 -. definition reload required .-> L1
  L1 --> L2
  P2 -. restart required .-> L3
  L3 --> L4
  P1 --> V
  P2 --> V
  P3 --> V
  P4 --> V
  L1 --> V
  L2 --> V
  L3 --> V
  L4 --> V
  V -- yes --> OK
  V -- no --> SB
  SB -. never reported as live or done .-> OK
